# The browser editor talks to the FastAPI/FFmpeg render engine on Railway.
#
# Production (Vercel): leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset. Vercel rewrites /api/*
# to the Railway service, so the browser only ever calls the same origin.
# This avoids any cross-origin (CORS) dependency on the render service.
#
# Local development: also leave unset; vite.config.ts already proxies /api to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 while `npm run dev` is running.
#
# Direct/fallback mode: set this to the public Railway URL to have the browser
# call the render service directly (requires the service's CORS allow-list to
# include this site's origin).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=